---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

---
<Base title="Custom Websites & Mobile Apps" description="Custom websites and mobile apps for businesses of every size, designed around how you work and connected to your systems. Scoped and quoted separately." current="services">
<section aria-labelledby="h1" style="padding:clamp(32px,4vw,48px) 0 clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px)">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:clamp(32px,5vw,64px)"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#585E5A">chevron_right</span><a href="/services">Services</a><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#585E5A">chevron_right</span><span aria-current="page" style="color:#585E5A">Custom Websites &amp; Mobile Apps</span></nav>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,420px),1fr));gap:clamp(40px,6vw,80px);align-items:center">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px">
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">Custom work · scoped and quoted separately</p>
<h1 id="h1" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,48px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.025em;text-wrap:balance">Custom websites and mobile apps</h1>
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(20px,2vw,24px);line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#0F4C45;text-wrap:balance">Designed around how your business works, and connected to the systems you use.</p>
<p style="font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;max-width:58ch">We design and build custom websites, beyond the free static site, and mobile apps for businesses of every size. Each one is built around how you work and can connect to your systems and our AI services where that helps. Every project is scoped and quoted separately.</p>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:8px">
<a class="x1" href="/book-a-discovery-call" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:52px;padding:0 28px;border-radius:999px;background:#0F4C45;color:#FAF7F2;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;text-decoration:none">Book a Discovery Call</a>
<a class="x2" href="#build" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:52px;padding:0 28px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid #0F4C45;color:#0F4C45;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;text-decoration:none">What we build</a>
</div>
</div>
<div aria-hidden="true" style="position:relative;padding:0 48px 48px 0">
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 64px rgba(15,76,69,.10)">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6;background:#F5F1EA"><span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#DED5C6"></span><span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#DED5C6"></span><span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#DED5C6"></span></div>
<div style="aspect-ratio:16/10;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#F5F1EA 0 10px,#EFE9DF 10px 20px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px;text-align:center"><span style="font:13px/1.6 ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:#585E5A">website screen · sample design, not client work</span></div>
</div>
<div style="position:absolute;right:0;bottom:0;width:34%;min-width:140px;aspect-ratio:9/19;background:#fff;border:6px solid #1A211F;border-radius:28px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 48px rgba(15,76,69,.16)"><div style="width:100%;height:100%;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#F5F1EA 0 10px,#EFE9DF 10px 20px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:12px;text-align:center"><span style="font:11px/1.5 ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:#585E5A">app screen · sample</span></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="build" aria-labelledby="build-h" style="background:#EAF0F8;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0;scroll-margin-top:80px">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<h2 id="build-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:48px">What we build</h2>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,380px),1fr));gap:24px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(28px,3.5vw,40px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><span style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:14px;background:#DBE8F7;color:#2B5C8F;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#2B5C8F">web</span></span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Custom websites</h3><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Websites that go beyond the free static site, designed around how your business works and how your customers find and contact you.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(28px,3.5vw,40px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><span style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:14px;background:#DBE8F7;color:#2B5C8F;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#2B5C8F">smartphone</span></span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Mobile apps</h3><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Apps for your customers or your team, built around the way you actually work.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="conn-h" style="padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,380px),1fr));gap:clamp(32px,5vw,64px);align-items:start">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><h2 id="conn-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-wrap:balance">Connected where it helps</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;max-width:44ch">A custom site or app can connect to the rest of your system. We connect only what solves a real problem.</p></div>
<ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,240px),1fr));gap:16px">
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">forum</span><b style="font-size:17px">AI chat and voice</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A">Capture and qualify visitors from your site or app.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#A23E1E">forward_to_inbox</span><b style="font-size:17px">Automated communications</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A">Confirmations, reminders and follow-ups through workflows you approve.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#8A5A00">view_kanban</span><b style="font-size:17px">Your pipeline</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A">New leads land in your Client Pipeline &amp; Dashboard.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">hub</span><b style="font-size:17px">Your other systems</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A"><a href="/custom-integrations-software">Custom integrations</a> with the tools you already use.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="how-h" style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<h2 id="how-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:48px">How we work</h2>
<ol style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,240px),1fr));gap:24px">
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #2B5C8F"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#2B5C8F;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">1</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3">Understand</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">We learn your business and your actual challenges first.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #8A5A00"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#8A5A00;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">2</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3">Identify</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">We find where AI can genuinely create value for you.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #A23E1E"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#A23E1E;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">3</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3">Start Small</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">We implement one right-sized solution — no big upfront commitment.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #0F6B57"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#0F6B57;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">4</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3">Grow</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">We measure the results, then expand based on what you actually need next.</p></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="host-h" style="background:#EAF0F8;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:48px"><h2 id="host-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Hosting and support</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">We stay with you after launch, with ongoing support and optimization.</p></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:24px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #0F4C45;border-radius:16px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:32px;color:#0F4C45">cloud</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3">Our managed hosting</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Hosted on our managed AWS in the US, in your own isolated environment, with monitoring, maintenance and updates included.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:16px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:32px;color:#0F4C45">dns</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3">Your own server</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Prefer to keep your data on your own server? You can bring your own, and we'll set it up with you. This setup is scoped separately.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:16px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:32px;color:#0F4C45">support_agent</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3">Ongoing support and optimization</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">We keep finding and implementing improvements as your business grows.</p></div>
</div>
<p style="display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A;margin-top:24px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px">info</span>Every project is quoted as a fixed price after assessment and requirements gathering.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="faq-h" style="padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,340px),1fr));gap:clamp(32px,5vw,64px);align-items:start">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><h2 id="faq-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Custom work questions</h2><a href="/faq?topic=custom" style="font-weight:600;font-size:16px">See all questions →</a></div>
<div class="faq-span" style="border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6">
<details open="" style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x3" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">How is a custom project priced?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">Every custom website and mobile app is quoted as a fixed price, after we assess your needs and gather your requirements. Work starts only after you approve the quote.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x4" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">How is this different from the free website?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">The free static website comes with any AI service: up to 5 pages and one revision round (<a href="/free-website-terms">terms</a>). A custom website goes beyond that, designed around how your business works.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x5" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">Can it connect to the systems we already use?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">Yes. We build custom integrations with existing business systems, scoped as part of your project.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x6" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">Where will it be hosted?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">On our managed AWS hosting in the US by default, or on your own server if you prefer. A self-hosted setup is scoped separately.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x7" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">Who owns the website?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">You own your domain, hosting, website content and data.</p></details>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="cta-h" style="padding:0 0 clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px)">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<div style="background:#0F4C45;color:#FAF7F2;border-radius:24px;padding:clamp(40px,6vw,80px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,360px),1fr));gap:32px;align-items:center">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><h2 id="cta-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,44px);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-0.025em;text-wrap:balance">Have something custom in mind?</h2><p style="font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,20px);line-height:1.6;color:#DCE7E4;max-width:48ch">Tell us how your business works. We'll tell you what we'd build first, and what you may not need.</p></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:fit-content"><a class="x8" href="/book-a-discovery-call" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:56px;padding:0 32px;border-radius:999px;background:#FAF7F2;color:#0F4C45;font-weight:600;font-size:17px;text-decoration:none">Book a Discovery Call<span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px">arrow_forward</span></a><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:15px;color:#DCE7E4"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:18px;color:#DCE7E4">schedule</span>A 15-minute call</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

</Base>

<style>
.x1:hover{background:#0B3A35 !important;color:#FAF7F2 !important}
.x2:hover{background:#E3EDE9 !important;color:#0B3A35 !important}
.x3:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1D6B60 !important;outline-offset:2px !important}
.x4:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1D6B60 !important;outline-offset:2px !important}
.x5:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1D6B60 !important;outline-offset:2px !important}
.x6:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1D6B60 !important;outline-offset:2px !important}
.x7:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1D6B60 !important;outline-offset:2px !important}
.x8:hover{background:#E3EDE9 !important;color:#0B3A35 !important}
</style>
